  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: 4 × 3 ÷ 6 + 2 – 8 = 10 + 2 × 3 ÷ 5 – 18\n\nAccording to the question, if two numbers on the left-hand side are interchanged and two signs on the right-hand side are interchanged:\n\nOption 1) 4 and 6; ÷ and ×\n\n4 × 3 ÷ 6 + 2 – 8 = 10 + 2 × 3 ÷ 5 – 18 ⇒ 6 × 3 ÷ 4 + 2 – 8 = 10 + 2 ÷ 3 × 5 – 18\n\n⇒ 6 × __**3 ÷ 4**__ + 2 – 8 = 10 + __**2 ÷ 3**__ × 5 – 18\n\n⇒ __**6 × 0.75**__ + 2 – 8 = 10 + __**0.67 × 5**__ – 18\n\n⇒ __**4.5 + 2**__ – 8 = __**10 + 3.35**__ – 18\n\n⇒ __6.5 ____- 8__ = __**13.35 - 18**__\n\n⇒ -1.5 ≠ -4.65 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) 2 and 4; + and ×\n\n4 × 3 ÷ 6 + 2 – 8 = 10 + 2 × 3 ÷ 5 – 18 ⇒ 2 × 3 ÷ 6 + 4 – 8 = 10 × 2 + 3 ÷ 5 – 18\n\n⇒ 2 × __**3 ÷ 6**__ + 4 – 8 = 10 × 2 + __**3 ÷ 5**__ – 18\n\n⇒ __**2 × 2**__ + 4 – 8 = __**10 **____**×**____** 2**__ + 0.6 – 18\n\n⇒ __**4**____** + 4**__ – 8 = __**20**____** + 0.6**__ – 18\n\n⇒ __**8 – 8**__ = __**20.06**____** – 18**__\n\n⇒ 0 ≠ 2.06 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) 6 and 8; + and -\n\n4 × 3 ÷ 6 + 2 – 8 = 10 + 2 × 3 ÷ 5 – 18 ⇒ 4 × 3 ÷ 8 + 2 – 6 = 10 - 2 × 3 ÷ 5 + 18\n\n⇒ 4 × __**3 ÷ 8**__ + 2 – 6 = 10 - 2 × __**3 ÷ 5**__ + 18\n\n⇒ 4 × 0.375 + 2 – 6 = 10 - __**2 × 0.6**__ + 18\n\n⇒ __**1.5 + 2**__ – 6 = __**10 + 18**__ - 1.2\n\n⇒ __**3.5 – 6**__ = __**28 - 1.2**__\n\n⇒ -2.5 ≠ 26.8 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) 4 and 8; + and ÷\n\n4 × 3 ÷ 6 + 2 – 8 = 10 + 2 × 3 ÷ 5 – 18 ⇒ 8 × 3 ÷ 6 + 2 – 4 = 10 ÷ 2 × 3 + 5 – 18\n\n⇒ 8 × __**3 ÷ 6**__ + 2 – 4 = __**10 ÷ 2**__ × 3 + 5 – 18\n\n⇒ __**8 × 0.5**__ + 2 – 4 = __**5 × 3**__ + 5 – 18\n\n⇒ __**4 + 2**__ – 4 = __**15 + 5**__ – 18\n\n⇒ __**6 – 4**__ = **2**__**0 – 18**__\n\n⇒ 2 = 2 (LHS = RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 4\" is the correct answer.",
